        {
          "text": "You get what you pay for.. This phone has so little memory its virtually unusable. Even buying an SD card will not help you bc Android has nerfed SD cards to where you can't install full apps on them anymore. Also the charging port messed up after less than a year. I'd recommend just spending a bit more and getting an LG Stylo with double the memory, a much better screen, and better build quality.",
          "aspect": "build",
