          "stars": 2,
          "month": "2016-01"
        },
        {
          "text": "very happy... very happy....this is a PHONE and not the data-done-right device.....the seller was helpful to answer that and make sure I got the right thing....not a super fancy phone, but didn't want that....phone calls, texting, internet and camera were what my son wanted and that's what he got - he is very happy and I am too. THANKS!",
